"While both KeyHue modes are enabled, automatic or ABC defaults and remembered ABC use KeyHue English, and 2-Set Korean uses KeyHue Korean. When integration is off or a mode is missing, remembered KeyHue modes use ABC and 2-Set Korean again. Your saved settings remain unchanged. If selection fails, the original policy is used." = "While both KeyHue modes are enabled, automatic or ABC defaults and remembered ABC use KeyHue English, and 2-Set Korean uses KeyHue Korean. When integration is off or a mode is missing, remembered KeyHue modes use ABC and 2-Set Korean again. Your saved settings remain unchanged. If selection fails, the original policy is used.";
